sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer as Khách hàng
    actor Admin as Admin/Staff
    participant FE as Frontend Webapp
    participant API as Backend API
    participant PayCtrl as VnPayPaymentController
    participant PaySvc as VnPayService
    participant OrderSvc as Order Service
    participant VNPay as VNPay Gateway
    participant DB as Database

    Note over Customer,DB: 6. Luồng thanh toán VNPay

    Customer->>FE: Chọn thanh toán VNPay cho order
    FE->>API: POST /payments/vnpay/create?orderId={id}
    API->>PayCtrl: createPayment(orderId)
    PayCtrl->>PaySvc: createPaymentUrl(orderId, request)
    PaySvc->>OrderSvc: Kiểm tra order hợp lệ và số tiền
    OrderSvc->>DB: Query order + payment status
    DB-->>OrderSvc: Order data
    OrderSvc-->>PaySvc: Amount + order code
    PaySvc->>PaySvc: Build params + secure hash
    PaySvc-->>PayCtrl: VNPay payment URL
    PayCtrl-->>API: ApiResponse(paymentUrl)
    API-->>FE: Payment URL
    FE-->>Customer: Redirect sang VNPay

    Customer->>VNPay: Nhập thông tin thanh toán
    alt Thanh toán thành công
        VNPay-->>API: GET /payments/vnpay/return?vnp_* params
        API->>PayCtrl: handleReturn(params)
        PayCtrl->>PaySvc: handleReturn(vnpParams)
        PaySvc->>PaySvc: Verify secure hash
        PaySvc->>DB: Update payment/order status success
        DB-->>PaySvc: Payment saved
        PaySvc-->>PayCtrl: VnPayReturnResponse success
        PayCtrl-->>FE: Redirect /checkout/vnpay-return?status=success
        FE-->>Customer: Hiển thị kết quả thanh toán thành công
    else Thanh toán thất bại hoặc sai chữ ký
        VNPay-->>API: GET /payments/vnpay/return?vnp_* params
        API->>PayCtrl: handleReturn(params)
        PayCtrl->>PaySvc: handleReturn(vnpParams)
        PaySvc->>PaySvc: Verify secure hash / response code
        PaySvc->>DB: Ghi payment log thất bại
        PaySvc-->>PayCtrl: Error or failed response
        PayCtrl-->>FE: Redirect /checkout/vnpay-return?status=error
        FE-->>Customer: Hiển thị kết quả thanh toán lỗi
    end

    opt Admin xem log giao dịch
        Admin->>FE: Mở payment logs
        FE->>API: GET /payments/logs
        API->>DB: Query payment transaction logs
        DB-->>API: Logs
        API-->>FE: ApiResponse(logs)
        FE-->>Admin: Hiển thị log giao dịch
    end
